# 2. Requirement Analysis Phase

**Project Name:** FitBuddy – AI Fitness Plan Generator using Gemini Models

## Functional Requirements

* User can enter name, age, weight, goal, and workout intensity.
* System generates a personalized 7-day workout plan.
* System provides nutrition and recovery tips.
* User can submit feedback to update the workout plan.
* System stores user and plan details.
* Admin can view users and their workout plans.

## Non-Functional Requirements

* Simple and user-friendly interface.
* Fast AI response.
* Secure data storage.
* Reliable and scalable application.

## Technology Requirements

* Python
* FastAPI
* Google Gemini AI
* HTML, CSS, Jinja2
* SQLite and SQLAlchemy
* Uvicorn
* Git
